picked up that project -- and it is on their package list (https://packages.fedoraproject.org/pkgs/mscgen/mscgen/index.html) as well as Debian's (https://tracker.debian.org/pkg/mscgen).  Is there more usage of the license beyond that?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2920256761/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2921337695","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2686#issuecomment-2921337695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2686","id":2921337695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86uIBNf","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T06:14:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T06:14:16Z","body":"> are both (or one of) these licenses used in Fedora??\n\nNo.\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2921337695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3115281981","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2686#issuecomment-3115281981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2686","id":3115281981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE865r249","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-24T23:12:04Z","updated_at":"2025-07-24T23:13:26Z","body":"Ok, so just spent probably too much time researching this, but here's what I found:\n- mscgen is listed as in Fedora but I downloaded that rpm and ran it through FOSSology and didn't find this license. I'm assuming it's probably similar for Debian, since that also uses mscgen\n- @jopejoe1  said the license was found NixOS (yeah, how about looking at the top of this thread!) and sure enough: https://search.nixos.org/packages?channel=25.05&from=0&size=50&sort=relevance&type=packages&query=mscgen\n\nSo, I guess the license is not in mscgen itself, but this Sphinx extension. \n\nI did find ~200+ hits in Github, many of which were related to Sphinx. These were also all v1.1 - only saw one instance of v1.0\n\nI'm going with its inclusion in NixOS as being significant enough to meet the substantial use prong of our inclusion guidelines and add my +1 to adding. Disclaimer: I'm not really familiar with NixOS\n\nBut given the age of this license, I'm inclined to just add v1.1 at this time.\n\nLet me know if anyone has a different thought!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3115281981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3117563991","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2686#issuecomment-3117563991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2686","id":3117563991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8650kBX","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfont